meta {
  name: Track Order
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/client/orders/{{client_order_id}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{client_token}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # Track Order (show)

  Returns full order with category, assigned master (when set),
  photos, tasks (before/after WebP) and schedule.

  Schedule fields (always present):
  - `preferred_date` — `Y-m-d` or `null` if urgent
  - `time_slot` — `08-10`…`18-20` or `null` (flexible)
  - `time_slot_label` — `10:00 - 12:00` for UI
  - `time_flexible` — `true` when no slot
  - `is_urgent` / `urgency_fee` — urgency + snapshotted fee
  - `cancel_fee` — set after cancel, otherwise `null`

  When order status is `assigned` or `in_progress`, `master.location` contains
  the master's latest GPS ping (`lat`, `lng`, `recorded_at`). For all other
  statuses `master.location` is `null`.

  У каждой подзадачи есть `price` (цену выставляет админ, `null` пока не
  выставлена). Разбивка по заказу:

  - `tasks_total` — сумма цен подзадач до скидки
  - `discount_percent` — скидка в процентах (`0`, если скидки нет)
  - `discount_amount` — сумма скидки в манатах
  - `final_price` = `tasks_total` − `discount_amount` — сколько платит клиент

  **Response 200:**
  ```json
  {
    "data": {
      "id": 1,
      "status": "assigned",
      "status_label": "Назначен",
      "description": "Кран в ванной течёт",
      "preferred_date": "2026-09-16",
      "time_slot": "10-12",
      "time_slot_label": "10:00 - 12:00",
      "time_flexible": false,
      "is_urgent": false,
      "urgency_fee": null,
      "cancel_fee": null,
      "client_address": "ул. Атамырата Ниязова, д. 42",
      "final_price": 270,
      "discount_percent": 10,
      "tasks_total": 300,
      "discount_amount": 30,
      "category": { "id": 3, "name": "Сантехника" },
      "master": {
        "id": 11,
        "name": "Aydogdy Ussadow",
        "phone": "+99362111222",
        "location": {
          "lat": 37.9364,
          "lng": 58.3795,
          "recorded_at": "2026-06-15T14:32:00"
        }
      },
      "photos": [
        { "id": 1, "url": "https://...", "status": "done" }
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": 7,
          "title": "Замена смесителя",
          "description": "Старый смеситель протекает",
          "price": 300,
          "before_photos": [
            { "id": 1, "url": "https://...", "status": "done" }
          ],
          "after_photos": []
        }
      ],
      "created_at": "2026-05-16 10:00:00"
    }
  }
  ```

  Фото задач приходят массивами (до 2 штук на тип), в том же формате, что и в мастерском API.

  **Errors:**
  - `403` — order does not belong to this client
  - `404` — order not found
}
